        "thought_text": "Thought-1 (revised): Instead of decrementing one at a time until reaching the minimum allowed value, calculate how many decrements can be made without violating the constraints and then directly compute the resulting product. This approach minimizes the number of operations and avoids potential timeouts due to excessive iterations.",
